# shell: tracker
# home: fixture
# PVS-011: a double click INSIDE the Location column answers with the
# containing folder, not the row -- a folder row is NOT entered from its
# Location cell, while the same clicks on its Name still enter it.
wait 8
click 150 36
wait 3
menu-pick Location
wait 3
note sub's Location cell: the view stays where it is instead of entering
click 720 102
wait 3
expect-selected-name sub
click 720 102
wait 1
click 720 102
wait 6
expect-no-title sub
note sub's Name: entered as always
click 100 102
wait 1
click 100 102
wait 6
expect-title sub
quit
